 - Calendar: fixed ordering; patient IDs are normalized on lookup (`normalize_patient_id`).
 - Appointments can be cancelled; patients have a Community Services Card (CSC) flag.
 - Pricing: `session_price` for assessments and follow-ups.
+- Pricing: `appointment_price` gives what the patient pays for an appointment. New prices ($105 assessment, $78 follow-up) apply to appointments from 1 April 2027 (clinic local date); CSC holders get 20% off follow-ups.
